<main class="zd-experiments">

  <section class="zde-hero">
    <p class="zde-eyebrow">Current Experiments</p>
    <h1>Small tests that may become real Ziyu products.</h1>
    <p>
      This is where Ziyu Development explores early ideas, unfinished concepts,
      feature tests, and small experiments before they become full projects.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="zde-filter">
    <button class="is-active">All</button>
    <button>Apps</button>
    <button>Goal Grower</button>
    <button>Store</button>
    <button>Community</button>
    <button>Design</button>
  </section>

  <section class="zde-grid">

    <article class="zde-feature">
      <div class="zde-feature__image">
        <img
          src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDNmmfCsH2wkKIic1auKPW9U9px3FVZtc9LKraKWSOVU6ex-77Ra4N9ArmC91U7voWHzjVAR7GWjxbzDldalUW56ATsYZ4IMMOqj_EvmOVbu7vzE8VmLxzawVN4OENpQegKAN2O6SNzBOGbw7nUEutD7cHFn5nrpqVjPq-89J5cHZcgzT-TKogLWfxOaf8hT-ltJ9uxFx0wxkWMfbPaqTU_N8mz2EcNgX5441KZhjkDI1b8jzr1TDZx2xsdVtV6IrvT0-ZtXbyLc2ro"
          alt="Experiment workspace"
          width="1200"
          height="700"
        >
      </div>

      <div class="zde-meta">
        <span>Goal Grower</span>
        <time>Active</time>
      </div>

      <h2>Shared Garden testing.</h2>
      <p>
        Testing how shared gardens work for real accountability groups, couples,
        friends, and people trying to keep goals together.
      </p>
    </article>

    <aside class="zde-status">
      <p class="zde-eyebrow">Experiment Log</p>
      <h3>What counts as an experiment?</h3>
      <p>
        Experiments are not promises. They are early ideas being tested for clarity,
        usefulness, design quality, and whether they should become real products.
      </p>

      <div class="zde-status-list">
        <span>Testing ideas</span>
        <span>Finding what works</span>
        <span>Building in public</span>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <article class="zde-card">
      <div class="zde-meta">
        <span>App Feature</span>
        <time>Testing</time>
      </div>
      <h3>Goal plant health.</h3>
      <p>
        Tuning how plants grow, fade, recover, and respond when users do or do not
        water their goals.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="zde-card">
      <div class="zde-meta">
        <span>Community</span>
        <time>Open</time>
      </div>
      <h3>Beta tester feedback loop.</h3>
      <p>
        Creating a better way for testers to report bugs, suggest improvements,
        and help shape launch priorities.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="zde-card">
      <div class="zde-meta">
        <span>Store</span>
        <time>Exploring</time>
      </div>
      <h3>Support-based products.</h3>
      <p>
        Testing products that help fund development without promising rewards or
        unrealistic outcomes.
      </p>
    </article>

  </section>

  <section class="zde-lab">
    <div class="zde-lab__intro">
      <p class="zde-eyebrow">The Lab</p>
      <h2>Ideas currently being considered.</h2>
      <p>
        These concepts may change, merge, disappear, or become full Ziyu Development
        projects depending on testing, usefulness, and community feedback.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="zde-lab-list">
      <article>
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Shared garden groups</h3>
        <p>Testing accountability gardens for couples, friends, classes, and small groups.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Project idea pitches</h3>
        <p>Creating a place where people can suggest apps, websites, tools, and automations.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Supporter updates</h3>
        <p>Exploring better ways to show supporters what their support is helping build.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Physical product direction</h3>
        <p>Testing whether merch, desk products, and app-related items fit the brand.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zde-cta">
    <p class="zde-eyebrow">Help Test Ideas</p>
    <h2>Experiments become better when people use them.</h2>
    <p>
      Join the community, support development, or pitch a project idea for Ziyu
      Development to explore.
    </p>

    <div class="zde-actions">
      <a href="/pages/community">Join the Community</a>
      <a href="/pages/support">Support Development</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Current Experiments Page",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Current Experiments Page"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}